{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23840","headline":"陕府王大夫相迎偶赠 · 白居易","name":"陕府王大夫相迎偶赠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"紫微阁老自多情，白首园公岂要迎。\n伴我绿槐阴下歇，向君红斾影前行。\n纶巾发少浑欹仄，篮轝肩齐甚稳平。\n但问主人留几日，分司宾客去无程。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23840.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23840","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}